{"id":71251,"date":"2026-10-28T16:29:22","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:29:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71251"},"modified":"2026-10-28T17:33:04","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:33:04","slug":"corrida-de-ano-novo-esposende","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-ano-novo-esposende\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>16 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), em <strong>Esposende<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>, marcando o arranque da \u00e9poca desportiva de estrada no litoral minhoto. Com partida e meta instaladas na central <strong>Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos<\/strong>, o evento re\u00fane uma prova competitiva noturna de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong>, antecedidas pela <strong>Kids Run<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es jovens.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Disputado num tra\u00e7ado urbano plano e r\u00e1pido em asfalto, o percurso de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e a caminhada de <strong>8 km<\/strong> levam-te a correr ao longo da emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Avenida Eng.\u00ba Eduardo Arantes e Oliveira<\/strong>, acompanhando a frente ribeirinha do estu\u00e1rio do <strong>Rio C\u00e1vado<\/strong> em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 <strong>Avenida dos Banhos<\/strong> e \u00e0 <strong>Rua do Farol<\/strong>, junto ao hist\u00f3rico <strong>Forte de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Baptista e Farol de Esposende<\/strong>. A <strong>Kids Run<\/strong> contempla dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas de <strong>800 metros<\/strong> (Benjamins) e <strong>1.609 metros \/ 1 milha<\/strong> (Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis) entre a Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos e a marginal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Esposende<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong>Esposende 2000 EM<\/strong>, Esposende Ambiente e clubes locais como a ADE Trail Run, Spin & Run e o Centro Social da Juventude de Mar, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, tempo limite de 2h30 (encerramento \u00e0s 20:30), posto de abastecimento aos 5 km e refor\u00e7o l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido na meta. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">16 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos, Esposende, Braga<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida), 8 km (Caminhada) e Kids Run (800 m e 1,6 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Esposende<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2h30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Asfalto e art\u00e9rias urbanas junto \u00e0 frente ribeirinha e mar\u00edtima de Esposende<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Plano e r\u00e1pido ao longo da Marginal do C\u00e1vado e da zona do Farol de Esposende<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Log\u00edstica & Apoio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Secretariado no Posto de Turismo de Esposende (Av. Eng.\u00ba Arantes e Oliveira, em frente \u00e0s Piscinas Municipais, 09:00\u201317:30), abastecimento l\u00edquido ao km 5 e l\u00edquido\/s\u00f3lido na meta, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha finisher nos 10 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.desporto.esposende.pt\/op\/document\/?co=2674&amp;h=1b9f5&amp;file=regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida de Ano Novo 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 2h30<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Km 5 (\u00c1gua) e Meta (\u00c1gua + S\u00f3lidos)<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 05\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/01 a 13\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 2h30<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Km 5 (\u00c1gua) e Meta (\u00c1gua + S\u00f3lidos)<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 4.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 05\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 6.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/01 a 13\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Run (Benjamins 800 m | Infantis a Juvenis 1.609 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida da Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027, na Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos, em Esposende. A Kids Run parte \u00e0s 16:00 (abertura do controlo zero \u00e0s 15:45), enquanto a Corrida de 10 km e a Caminhada de 8 km partem em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 18:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 17:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para os 10 km, Caminhada e Kids Run?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km (limite de 1.700 vagas), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 5 de janeiro de 2027 e 15,00 \u20ac de 6 a 13 de janeiro de 2027. Na Caminhada de 8 km (limite de 500 vagas), o valor \u00e9 de 4,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 5 de janeiro e 6,00 \u20ac de 6 a 13 de janeiro de 2027. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o na Kids Run \u00e9 gratuita.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027), entre as 09:00 e as 17:30, no Posto de Turismo de Esposende, localizado na Avenida Eng.\u00ba Eduardo Arantes e Oliveira (em frente \u00e0s Piscinas Municipais). \u00c9 necess\u00e1ria a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do QR Code da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e do Cart\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso e onde est\u00e3o localizados os abastecimentos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Com partida e chegada na Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos, o tra\u00e7ado percorre a Avenida Eng.\u00ba Eduardo Arantes e Oliveira (marginal de Esposende), Avenida Rocha Gon\u00e7alves, Avenida dos Banhos e Rua do Farol. Existe posto de abastecimento com \u00e1gua ao km 5 e refor\u00e7o de \u00e1gua e s\u00f3lidos na meta. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 2h30 (encerramento \u00e0s 20:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027 e que escal\u00f5es existem?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Esposende com o apoio da Esposende 2000 EM e clubes concelhios. A Corrida de 10 km atribui trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros da geral M\/F, \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas e aos p\u00f3dios dos escal\u00f5es Sub-23 (18\u201322 anos), Seniores (23\u201339), Vet M\/F 40 (40\u201349), Vet M\/F 50 (50\u201359) e Vet M\/F 60 (60+ anos), al\u00e9m de medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os finalistas.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua Santa Maria dos Anjos, Esposende\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Esposende\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Corrida de Ano Novo Esposende 2027 realiza-se a 16 de janeiro em Esposende. Prova noturna de 10 km, caminhada de 8 km e Kids Run. Garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/corrida-de-ano-novo-esposende-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida de Ano Novo 10 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.desporto.esposende.pt\/x-corrida-de-ano-novo\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 8 km\", \"price\": \"4.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.desporto.esposende.pt\/x-corrida-de-ano-novo\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Kids Run (Benjamins 800 m | Infantis a Juvenis 1.609 m)\", \"price\":